#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Low Battery Warning and Low Battery Critical Panels"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These two modules work together to control what happens when a predetermined "
"low battery condition occurs. There are two of them, so you can set a "
"warning for when time is getting close, and something more desperate for the "
"last minute save or suspend."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Use</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: emphasis
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Low trigger"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This field specifies at which point the battery low state is detected - it "
"is the number of minutes left (according to APM) in your batteries. When "
"this number is crossed the low state is triggered and one or more of the "
"following things will occur"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run Command"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a shell command that will be executed when the battery low is "
"detected. By default, this is turned off."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Play Sound"
msgstr "Legir lo son"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This specifies a sound to play when battery low is detected. Simply specify "
"the path to the file to have it played. By default, this is turned off."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "System Beep"
msgstr "Bip sistèma"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this will cause the battery monitor to beep whenever the battery "
"level drops below the preset value. This is probably the least intrusive, "
"yet still active, method of alerting the user that the battery is low. By "
"default, this is on."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notify"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this will cause Battery to pop up a window when the battery becomes "
"low."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Suspend"
msgstr "Suspendre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have set up <filename>/usr/bin/apm</filename> to be run setuid (see "
"the instructions for the <guilabel>Power</guilabel> panel) then this check "
"box will appear - if checked it will cause your computer to be put into "
"<guilabel>Suspend</guilabel> mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standby"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like <guilabel>Suspend</guilabel> above, but it puts your computer into "
"<guilabel>Standby</guilabel> mode."
msgstr ""

